{"title":"Career Roadmap · Site Engineer","role":"Site Engineer","summary":"A Site Engineer plans, supervises, coordinates, and monitors construction activities at a project site. The role combines civil engineering knowledge with construction execution, surveying, drawings, estimation, quality control, safety, scheduling, billing, and contractor coordination.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a Civil Engineering graduate, this is one of the most direct entry-level career paths."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Typical career stage","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Graduate / Site Engineer"},{"text":"Site execution, drawings, surveying, QA/QC, quantity measurement"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Senior Site Engineer"},{"text":"Independent site sections, contractors, planning, billing"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Project / Construction Engineer"},{"text":"Project coordination, cost, schedule, quality and teams"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Project Manager / Construction Manager"},{"text":"Large-project delivery, contracts, budgets and leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Main objective","Key skills","Proof of progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Civil engineering foundation"},{"text":"Engineering drawing, surveying basics, materials, mechanics, AutoCAD"},{"text":"Building drawing + surveying exercise"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Construction fundamentals"},{"text":"RCC, steel, geotechnical, concrete technology, estimation"},{"text":"Quantity-estimation project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Site execution skills"},{"text":"AutoCAD, Revit, Primavera/MS Project, QA/QC, surveying"},{"text":"Construction internship + site reports"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Job-ready site engineer"},{"text":"BOQ, 